### 1. Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### 2. Create Workspace
# @name createWorkspace
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "My Awesome Workspace",
  "description": "This is my first workspace"
}

### 3. Get All User Workspaces
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4. Get Workspace by ID
# @name getWorkspace
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 5. Update Workspace
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Updated Workspace Name",
  "description": "This description has been updated"
}

### 6. Get Workspace Members
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/members
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 7. Update Member Role
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/members/MEMBER_ID/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 8. Remove Member
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/members/MEMBER_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 9. Delete Workspace
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN